# Keys of the API service only. Copy this folder to ../secrets (gitignored, directory 0700, files 0600).
# src/config.ts refuses an API process that holds a settlement, anchoring, slashing or keeper key.

# The router signing key: co-signs x402 `exact` payments as fee payer and is the default tab payee. A base58 64-byte
# ed25519 secret key. Fund its address with a little SOL for transaction fees (MONITORING.md has the floor).
ROUTER_PRIVATE_KEY=

# The hosted x402 facilitator (schemes `exact` and `tab`). Its relay key only pays transaction fees and must be its own
# key: the router refuses one that equals any other role key. Enabled here and nowhere else, because a process with
# FACILITATOR_ENABLED=true must also hold the relay key. In production it needs SANCTIONS_SCREENING_ENABLED=true.
# On the launch since 2026-11-04: the relay pays each settlement's network fee and recovers nothing.
FACILITATOR_ENABLED=true
FACILITATOR_RELAY_PRIVATE_KEY=
